      "instruction": "Required solver: OpenSees.\nUse OpenSees to analyze a rigid-jointed one-story steel frame with span 6 m, height 4 m and both column bases fixed. Case D has only one nodal load: +X 50 kN at the right roof joint n1-1. The two roof joints retain independent degrees of freedom. Report ux at each column top, N, V3 and M2 at both ends of roof beam b0-1, and horizontal shear reaction Fx and bending reaction My at both column bases. Use the complete geometry and properties in the appendices.\n\nUse all public appendices. Report the complete requested numerical table and the required summaries.",
